{"id":"boundary_rule_001","chunk_id":"boundary_rule_001","title":"议程与总结边界","content":"会议议程回答讨论什么、按什么顺序推进；会议总结回答实际讨论了什么、有哪些分歧、取舍和整体结果。议程不得承载结论、待办、遗留问题或风险。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"cross_dimension","knowledge_type":"boundary_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"boundary_rule_002","chunk_id":"boundary_rule_002","title":"总结与结论边界","content":"会议总结覆盖过程全貌，核心结论只保留已确认的决定。总结可以描述讨论和取舍；结论必须有明确确认、接受、敲定或执行信号支撑。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"cross_dimension","knowledge_type":"boundary_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"boundary_rule_007","chunk_id":"boundary_rule_007","title":"背景与遗留问题边界","content":"投诉、现象和业务背景本身不自动属于遗留问题。只有会议结束时仍存在具体未闭环点，且没有明确答案、解决结论或足以闭环的执行安排时，才归入遗留问题。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"unresolved_issues","knowledge_type":"boundary_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"boundary_rule_009","chunk_id":"boundary_rule_009","title":"提问与遗留问题边界","content":"会议中的疑问不等于遗留问题。如果问题在会议中得到回答或形成处理方案，则不进入遗留问题；只有会后仍无答案、无方案或被搁置的问题才属于遗留问题。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"unresolved_issues","knowledge_type":"boundary_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"boundary_rule_010","chunk_id":"boundary_rule_010","title":"总结禁止原文拼接","content":"会议总结必须对整场会议进行归纳重写，不能将多句原始发言直接拼接成总结。总结应体现背景、讨论、分歧、取舍和整体结果之间的逻辑关系。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"meeting_summary","knowledge_type":"boundary_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"boundary_rule_011","chunk_id":"boundary_rule_011","title":"跨维度语义角色规则","content":"同一业务事实可以支撑不同维度，但输出必须体现不同语义角色。例如推荐功能延期可作为结论；缺少行为数据体系可作为遗留问题，但不能把完全相同句子重复放入两个维度。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"cross_dimension","knowledge_type":"boundary_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"negative_example_001","chunk_id":"negative_example_001","title":"反例：痛点当遗留问题","content":"错误：把批量下载卡顿直接归入遗留问题。原因：这是背景和当前痛点，除非会议明确确认本次无法解决或搁置，否则不能判为遗留问题。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"unresolved_issues","knowledge_type":"negative_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"negative_example_002","chunk_id":"negative_example_002","title":"反例：建议当结论","content":"错误：研发说建议冻结需求后立即归入核心结论。原因：建议尚未被接受；只有明确同意并确认后才能生成结论。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"key_conclusions","knowledge_type":"negative_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"negative_example_003","chunk_id":"negative_example_003","title":"反例：待办当遗留问题","content":"错误：产品后续补充标签规则归入遗留问题。原因：已有明确执行动作和责任主体。正确分类：待办与后续安排。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"cross_dimension","knowledge_type":"negative_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"negative_example_004","chunk_id":"negative_example_004","title":"反例：风险当待办","content":"错误：高频下载可能造成服务器压力归入待办。正确分类：风险；制定下载频率限制才是待办。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"cross_dimension","knowledge_type":"negative_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"negative_example_005","chunk_id":"negative_example_005","title":"反例：总结复制原话","content":"错误：把多句原始发言直接拼接成会议总结。正确做法：归纳会议背景、讨论过程、取舍和整体结果，形成连贯全景概括。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"meeting_summary","knowledge_type":"negative_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"negative_example_006","chunk_id":"negative_example_006","title":"反例：结论待办重复","content":"错误：将需求冻结既写为核心结论，又把完全相同内容写入待办。正确做法：规则性共识归入核心结论；只有具体执行动作才进入待办。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"cross_dimension","knowledge_type":"negative_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"negative_example_007","chunk_id":"negative_example_007","title":"反例：已解决问题仍遗留","content":"错误：旧数据是否兼容已明确决定必须102%兼容，却仍列为遗留问题。正确处理：问题已闭环，不进入遗留问题。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"unresolved_issues","knowledge_type":"negative_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"negative_example_008","chunk_id":"negative_example_008","title":"反例：编造负责人","content":"错误：会议只说需要补充迁移方案，模型自行指定研发负责人。正确做法：原文没有明确责任人时 owner_name 返回 null。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"negative_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"negative_example_009","chunk_id":"negative_example_009","title":"反例：编造风险","content":"错误：会议未讨论安全、隐私或成本，却自动生成数据泄露或成本超支风险。正确做法：风险必须有会议证据或可解释证据链。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"risks_and_focus","knowledge_type":"negative_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"negative_example_010","chunk_id":"negative_example_010","title":"反例：重复待办","content":"错误：后续搭建数据体系后再排期推荐功能被拆成多条相同待办。正确做法：若暂无明确执行承诺和排期，应归入遗留问题并合并重复表达。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"cross_dimension","knowledge_type":"negative_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_boundary_rule_008","chunk_id":"v4_boundary_rule_008","title":"边界：当前事实与风险边界-1","content":"当前已经发生的低转化、库存不足、权限缺失或机制缺失属于当前事实或遗留问题。只有会议明确讨论其未来可能触发的不利事件或影响时，才另外提取风险。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"cross_dimension","knowledge_type":"boundary_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_boundary_rule_010","chunk_id":"v4_boundary_rule_010","title":"边界：会议级时间与任务截止时间边界-1","content":"项目整体上线时间、活动窗口和会议目标日期不能自动传播给所有待办。只有时间与具体任务处于同一语义单元，或通过清晰指代链明确绑定时，才能填写该任务的 deadline。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"boundary_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_boundary_rule_012","chunk_id":"v4_boundary_rule_012","title":"边界：风险应对与风险本体边界-1","content":"风险本体描述未来可能发生的不利事件及影响；风险应对描述可能采取的动作。只有会议明确决定或接受执行某项应对措施时，该措施才进入待办。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"cross_dimension","knowledge_type":"boundary_rule","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_negative_example_001","chunk_id":"v4_negative_example_001","title":"反例：把建议当结论-1","content":"错误：有人说‘建议降价’就输出‘确定降价’。正确：没有确认信号时，不能进入核心结论。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"key_conclusions","knowledge_type":"negative_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_negative_example_002","chunk_id":"v4_negative_example_002","title":"反例：把遗留问题自动变待办-1","content":"错误：原文只有‘没有差评监控机制’，却生成‘建立差评监控机制’待办。正确：仅归入遗留问题。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"cross_dimension","knowledge_type":"negative_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_negative_example_003","chunk_id":"v4_negative_example_003","title":"反例：把说话人当负责人-1","content":"错误：产品说‘运营侧需要提供素材’，负责人写产品。正确：负责人应为运营侧。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"negative_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_negative_example_004","chunk_id":"v4_negative_example_004","title":"反例：错误传播 deadline-1","content":"错误：会议说‘8月1日上线’，就给所有待办填‘8月3日’。正确：任务时间必须有任务级绑定。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"negative_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_negative_example_005","chunk_id":"v4_negative_example_005","title":"反例：claim 和 source 不一致-1","content":"错误：claim 为‘取消推荐功能’，source 却引用‘历史数据兼容’。正确：证据片段必须直接支持该 claim；仅主题相关但语义不支持的片段不能作为证据。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"evidence","knowledge_type":"negative_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_negative_example_006","chunk_id":"v4_negative_example_006","title":"反例：编造会议事实-1","content":"错误：当前会议未讨论某项功能，却从 RAG 示例或历史会议中复制该事实。正确：RAG 示例只用于理解规则，输出事实必须来自当前会议原文。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"evidence","knowledge_type":"negative_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_negative_example_007","chunk_id":"v4_negative_example_007","title":"反例：风险和问题混淆-1","content":"错误：当前没有监控机制被写成未来风险。正确：机制缺失是遗留问题，差评持续导致掉权重才是风险。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"cross_dimension","knowledge_type":"negative_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_negative_example_008","chunk_id":"v4_negative_example_008","title":"反例：风险和待办混淆-1","content":"错误：‘转化起不来可能亏损’被写成待办。正确：这是风险；缩减预算只有明确决定执行时才是待办。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"cross_dimension","knowledge_type":"negative_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_negative_example_009","chunk_id":"v4_negative_example_009","title":"反例：沉默视为共识-1","content":"错误：某人提出方案后无人反对，就视为会议已确认。正确：沉默、话题切换或未回应均不等于共识；需要明确同意、确认、敲定或执行信号。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"key_conclusions","knowledge_type":"negative_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_negative_example_010","chunk_id":"v4_negative_example_010","title":"反例：合并不同负责人任务-1","content":"错误：把不同动作或不同责任主体的任务合并成一个待办。正确：按独立动作和责任主体拆分；同一负责人承担紧密相连的连续动作时，才可合并为一项。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"negative_example","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_reasoning_pattern_003","chunk_id":"v4_reasoning_pattern_003","title":"推理：条件风险链-1","content":"按‘触发条件 → 未来不利事件 → 影响结果’识别风险。应对措施不得混入风险本体；只有会议明确决定执行时，才单独生成待办。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"risks_and_focus","knowledge_type":"reasoning_pattern","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_reasoning_pattern_007","chunk_id":"v4_reasoning_pattern_007","title":"推理：跨轮次指代-1","content":"‘没问题，我来处理’只能在相邻轮次、同一主题、上一轮任务对象唯一且承诺关系清晰时恢复动作对象。跨主题、多人候选或指代不清时，不得强行关联。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"action_items","knowledge_type":"reasoning_pattern","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
{"id":"v4_reasoning_pattern_008","chunk_id":"v4_reasoning_pattern_008","title":"推理：阶段性取舍-1","content":"‘本月先做A，B长期搁置’中，只有会议明确确认优先级时，A优先可形成阶段性结论；A存在具体执行安排时再生成待办；B在仍未解决时进入遗留问题。","metadata":{"runtime_layer":"RAG_DYNAMIC","layer":"boundary","scenario":"all","dimension":"cross_dimension","knowledge_type":"reasoning_pattern","priority":"high","version":"2.1.1","dataset_version":"meeting_analyst_rag_v2_1_1","chunk_schema_version":"rag-chunk-v2.1.1","expert_review_version":"final-expert-v5","status":"approved"}}
